    <entry xml:lang="en">
        <title>Using Bit Flags to Pack Multiple States Efficiently</title>
        <published>2024-10-01T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2024-10-01T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>Unknown</name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://yazeed1s.github.io/posts/bit-flags/"/>
        <id>https://yazeed1s.github.io/posts/bit-flags/</id>
        
        <content type="html" xml:base="https://yazeed1s.github.io/posts/bit-flags/">&lt;p&gt;A struct of booleans is fine until you need to check combinations or pass the whole state around, and then it gets clunky. I ended up using bit flags for this in a few places, one integer where each bit is a condition, and I care less about the memory than about having the whole state in one value I can pass, store and compare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;the-pattern&quot;&gt;the pattern&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each flag is a different power of 2 so they never overlap (&lt;code&gt;1U&lt;/code&gt; so shifting into bit 31 isn&#39;t signed overflow):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-l-code z-d-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;c&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;typedef&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt; enum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    FLAG_NONE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    FLAG_A    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    FLAG_B    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    FLAG_C    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    FLAG_D    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-4 z-d-7&quot;&gt; flags_t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;flags &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;|=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; FLAG_A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;           /*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; set &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;*/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;flags &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; ~&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FLAG_A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;          /*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; clear &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;*/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;flags &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; FLAG_A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;  /*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; check &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;*/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;/*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; both A and B set &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;*/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;flags &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FLAG_A &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; FLAG_B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; ==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;FLAG_A &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;|&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; FLAG_B&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;monitor-changes-in-my-wm&quot;&gt;monitor changes in my WM&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In my window manager, when monitors get plugged or unplugged I collect what changed into one value:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-l-code z-d-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;c&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;typedef&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt; enum&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    MON_CHANGE_NONE         &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    MON_CHANGE_CONNECTED    &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    MON_CHANGE_DISCONNECTED &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    MON_CHANGE_LAYOUT       &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; &amp;lt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-4 z-d-7&quot;&gt; monitor_change_t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;void&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-1 z-d-5&quot;&gt; update_monitors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;uint32_t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;    *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;changes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; MON_CHANGE_NONE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;    if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;new_monitor_added&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;  *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;changes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;|=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; MON_CHANGE_CONNECTED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;    if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;monitor_removed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;    *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;changes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;|=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; MON_CHANGE_DISCONNECTED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;    if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;resolution_changed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;changes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;|=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; MON_CHANGE_LAYOUT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plug in a monitor with an unexpected resolution and both bits get set, &lt;code&gt;0b101&lt;/code&gt;, so the handler sees CONNECTED and LAYOUT in the same value and deals with each:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-l-code z-d-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;c&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;uint32_t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; m_change &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; MON_CHANGE_NONE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-1 z-d-5&quot;&gt;update_monitors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;m_change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;m_change &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; MON_CHANGE_NONE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt; return&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;m_change &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; MON_CHANGE_CONNECTED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;    {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; /*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; ... &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;*/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;m_change &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; MON_CHANGE_DISCONNECTED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; /*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; ... &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;*/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;m_change &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; MON_CHANGE_LAYOUT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;       {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; /*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; ... &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;*/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I used the same thing when I wrote a red-black tree, the validator returns one integer with a bit per broken rule (&lt;code&gt;RB_RED_ROOT&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RB_RED_CHILD_OF_RED&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;RB_UNEQUAL_BLACK_PATHS&lt;/code&gt;), and &lt;code&gt;0&lt;/code&gt; means the tree is valid. One return value can carry several problems at once, which beats an array of error codes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;why-uint32-t-and-not-uint8-t&quot;&gt;why uint32_t and not uint8_t&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With 4 flags &lt;code&gt;uint8_t&lt;/code&gt; looks like the obvious choice, but C promotes small types to &lt;code&gt;int&lt;/code&gt; before bitwise ops:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-l-code z-d-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;c&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;uint8_t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; flags &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt; 0x&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt;FF&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-1&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;~&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;flags &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;==&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-7 z-d-6&quot;&gt; 0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; ... &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-4&quot;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;  /*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt; false, ~flags is 0xFFFFFF00 as int &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-l-i z-d-2 z-d-i&quot;&gt;*/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s easy to write and annoying to debug. Shifts get promoted too, and shifting by the width of the type or more is undefined (&lt;code&gt;1U &amp;lt;&amp;lt; 32&lt;/code&gt; with 32-bit &lt;code&gt;unsigned int&lt;/code&gt;). You can store flags as &lt;code&gt;uint8_t&lt;/code&gt; and cast carefully, but &lt;code&gt;uint32_t&lt;/code&gt; is the boring choice, fits in a register, skips the promotion surprises, and gives you 32 flags.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;when-i-wouldn-t&quot;&gt;when I wouldn&#39;t&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;flags &amp;amp; FLAG_A&lt;/code&gt; reads worse than &lt;code&gt;state.is_connected&lt;/code&gt;, and printing &lt;code&gt;0x0A&lt;/code&gt; while debugging tells you less than &lt;code&gt;connected=true layout=true&lt;/code&gt;, so you end up writing a decode helper. If I have two or three conditions that never travel together, a struct of bools is simpler and I&#39;d just use that. Flags are worth it when the combination itself means something, events, options, validation results, capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
